{"overview":"یاما آشیهارا قرار بود یک جلسه آزمایشی از «جادوی واقعی» (AM) — اولین بازی VRMMO‑RPG تمام‌غوطه‌ور جهان — را همراه با همکلاسی‌هایش سوا آشیهارا، کنجی کوندو و میناغی سانوی تجربه کند. برنامه ساده بود: به‌عنوان یک تیم چهار نفره باس را شکست دهند، خارج شوند و تست را به‌سلامت به پایان برسانند — یا حداقل، این‌طور تصور می‌شد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Yuma Ashihara was set to enjoy a test session of Actual Magic (AM)—the world's first fulldive VRMMO-RPG—together with his classmates Sawa Ashihara, Kenji Kondo, and Minagi Sano. The plan was simple: defeat the boss as a party of four, log out, and finish the test play safely — or at least, that's how it was supposed to go.","tagline_en":"This is a game, — and it is real.","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":4,"y":2026,"poster":"/A1eNWdF1kgQy78hMl1RYutTvwbO.jpg"}],"episodes":3,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"白石晴香","role":"Yuma Ashihara (voice)","photo":"/hrQxTVNGLi3jXC7v4kETArpA0dV.jpg","en":"Haruka Shiraishi"},{"name":"稲垣好","role":"Sawa Ashihara (voice)","photo":"/qYizWDjykF0j5foMvKGYyRta037.jpg","en":"Konomi Inagaki"},{"name":"広瀬裕也","role":"Kenji Kondo (voice)","photo":"/jRe7ICqrCsaEWVD8jAmJdc7XwnQ.jpg","en":"Yuya Hirose"},{"name":"天野聡美","role":"Minagi Sano (voice)","photo":"/jXdNWagts97olrmDIAjdT17HdeS.jpg","en":"Satomi Amano"}],"trailer":"fB4EfJcItPE","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/328010-demonzu-kuresuto/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/gMZdpavHmxFNnLpMHwVxfqeux2g.png"},{"n":"Amazon Prime Video with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/tpwTT1FpWqLLhxUfAuDavIXDDfI.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/328010-demonzu-kuresuto/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/gMZdpavHmxFNnLpMHwVxfqeux2g.png"},{"n":"Amazon Prime Video with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/tpwTT1FpWqLLhxUfAuDavIXDDfI.png"}]},"CA":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/